{
  "server": "en",
  "storyId": "act5d0_level_act5d0_07_beg",
  "groupId": "act5d0",
  "stageId": "act5d0_07",
  "title": "11:08P.M.",
  "storyCode": "CB-7",
  "avgTag": "Before Operation",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/en/gamedata/story/activities/act5d0/level_act5d0_07_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "8643b6d06db8c155022942852b4ec7b0a53b1b86457b7788c929e7db4eda3491",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_motorway"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Boss, Penguin Logistics is on the move."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course. I just gave her a few skin deep cuts..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I'm more worried about Capone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Y- yeah, we haven't been able to reach him. Tried real hard an hour ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where's the last place you got him? The slums?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Er, yeah."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That's too bad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you mean?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tell all the crews, we're going with the original plan to get Penguin Logistics..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But I'm thinkin'... unless something goes wrong, we'll get two or three crews dropping off the grid."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What do you mean... boss?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Couldn't be... Capone betrayed the Family?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I get where he's comin' from. All too well."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We grew up together. And dad had us deal with a traitor, with our own two hands. That was my first time takin' a life. Our first time takin' a life."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Siracusa fiasco changed us. The only difference is he turned weak, and I chose the clear path."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "He's gonna sell out the Family. Or I guess he wants to give the Family a new name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So what should we do about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Penguin Logistics is turning out trickier than I thought. And we can't fight a war on too many fronts."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm thinkin' we deal with our traitor problem first."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm down at the intersection. Nothing special here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Roger. Proceed as usual."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W- wait! What's the plan here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? You screwed up something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, I just wanna be sure. I really don't know Lungmen at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's Sauin. When midnight rolls around, Lungmen kicks off a huge Carnival. The whole town turns out. That's when we rub out Penguin Logistics. Bada bing!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Now about the boss..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Don't ask too many questions. Just do what you're told. Chop-chop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...it's what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You ain't gonna kill me, are you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Of course not. But you gotta take a nap for me like a good boy~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Texas, you copy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the same over here. They all split off into little groups."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But their leader was in the fight himself, which means they've got someone else handing out dispatch orders."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We just have to cut off that head."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey~ Texas?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We're in the city center, but boy are there a lot of people out here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Watch for the enemy. They're moving in small teams."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know~ We'll make sure our friends on the street keep an eye out... Wait, boss? You want to get up on a float? Erm, wait for me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Croissant, Bison, do you copy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you were talking about that someone else giving dispatch orders, we ran into a little surprise over here."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Bison, get down. Take cover behind that box over there. Don't get yerself seen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Right. I'll call you back, Texas."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So where do we go from here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I dunno. Since we cut off the boss... since we cut off Gambino Ricci, we really don't have a choice."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's to sigh about? Mr. Capone did so much for us here in Lungmen, and what came of it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Gambino hops on over from Siracusa and makes nothin' but trouble. Not a lick of good's come of him!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If we kept to Mr. Capone's plan from the start, we wouldn't be in this mess."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've been over this with the Rat King. Why do we gotta kill anybody? This ain't Siracusa!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The boss, I mean the old boss, he's probably just blowin' off steam."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well he needs to grow up."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Sounds like trouble in paradise.)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Sure does. This could be good for us, if we...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso A",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hey! Who's there?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Huh? A gunshot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's that sniper again! We're exposed!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso B",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the Penguins! Don't let 'em get away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lungmen_n"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Do forgive me, Young Master. This is what the Master of the House has demanded of me."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But in taking action upon the Young Master, I have placed him in danger..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When this matter is concluded, I believe it may be time to retire to the countryside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Butler",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_029",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sigh."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Sounds like they're in trouble."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Exusiai, once you've marked out the gangsters' route, move to meet up with Croissant."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You got it~"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sora."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Whew... the bad guys are making a lot of moves, but it looks like they're splitting into two teams. Might be a trap..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It is not so complicated. The enemy is suffering from internal strife. This is an opportunity."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Aaaie! You scared me!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Welcome back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Why'd you have to hack into our private channel? Couldn't you just send us a normal message?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This was quicker."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Where are you now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "A depressing cafe. I suddenly remembered I was supposed to have today off, so I came out to enjoy the nightlife."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Yith",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I've sent you Croissant and the new boy's coordinates. Lungmen's network speeds are remarkably satisfactory."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...understood. Once we've finished our respective missions, we'll move to assist them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This is our chance to strike back."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_lmstreet_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Mr. Capone, the boss's hit on Penguin Logistics looks like it failed."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What's that meathead worth? I don't even wanna hear his name."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Is that how we do it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The Family needs a solid foundation. The name is the least important part."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Did you find the Rat King yet?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not yet. He really don't leave any tracks around..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We gotta be patient. He's like a part of the city. He's Lungmen's shadow. It ain't like we got much time though."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But we gotta be careful. If the Rat King picks up on what we're doin', we could find ourselves fighting three sides at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's the same for everyone. If we're locked into a tough spot, the best thing to do is stir up some chaos."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You got news of Gambino?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You deaf?"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you got somethin' to say to me, shouldn't you just say it to my face?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How did you get in here?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Not everybody's like you. Not everybody can just up and turn their back on an oath made before dad's grave."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Oath? That's just because we were walking the same path. But times have changed, Gambino."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You broke my heart, Capone. But I'll give you one last chance to explain yourself, as my brother."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hmph. Seven years ago, when we buried the old boss, you sent me here, to Lungmen."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I came halfway across the world to set up a business that could support the Family, like a backstop."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "But then you had to go and screw up in Siracusa. And what do you do? You hop on over here and take over everything I broke my back to build."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Come on, you ain't gettin' pissed off over some little shit like this. Or you'd've been dead a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Say what you want. But today I learned the sharpest fangs in the Family's what's gonna turn around and kill it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So you gonna pull out your fangs and snap a collar on yourself? Hah!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "If you keep runnin' around Lungmen makin' noise like you do, sooner or later the powers that be are gonna get sick of it and wipe us out."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Your deep and heartfelt concern for the Family is moving me to tears, dear Capone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The feeling's mutual."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "You're rusty."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "The scars you got in Siracusa are holding you back too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just give up. I don't wanna kill you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No, you really do."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heh. You know me too well."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Wh——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Well lookie here! I just wanted to bust through this wall and make a nice path... but it looks like I found quite a sight."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Croissant",
      "speakerId": "char_201_moeshd",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sorry to bother ya. You two keep at it. We'll go around."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Mafioso",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_031",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry! Don't let them get away!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Bison",
      "speakerId": "char_325_bison",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...I think we're out of options."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How about that. Our troublemakers came right to us. We'll just scoop you up and——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Gambino",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_028",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What is it this time?!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Exusiai",
      "speakerId": "char_103_angel",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Heyy~ We're heere!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What a coincidence, running into everyone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Sora",
      "speakerId": "char_101_sora",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "So, is it time for a final battle already? Seems a little early?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's fine. The sooner we get this whole thing over with, the better."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Texas",
      "speakerId": "char_102_texas",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Just throw them in the river, like the boss said."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This kind of chaos is just the way I like it."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Capone",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_027",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Tonight's big winner is the one who walks out of here alive."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
